Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 02:04:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] BUILD 3 REMEDIATION: causality assertion now checks ALL 180
 threshold keys with exact bitwise equality, splitting rolling-D from
 structural constants (was a 6-key dict-head sample testing only 2 rolling
 thresholds); rejection items 5 and 6 computed from the emitted artifact
 rather than asserted, every check carries a basis column; per-split
 random-triple null arm run end to end through the single-touch guard as a
 MEASUREMENT not a pass criterion; four recorded limitations into artifact
 headers; wall-clock excluded from artifacts to preserve determinism

